A watchdog already switched to rowt-rs (rowt #s65): state remembers
watch_impl=rust, and an agent is installed, so `watch refresh` has something to
rewrite. The plist here is only a stand-in; refresh replaces it whole.

  watch refresh                   an upgrade's refresh, empty environment: the
                                  choice survives, the plist keeps ROWT_IMPL=rust
  ROWT_IMPL=bash watch refresh    the way back: state says bash, and so does the
                                  plist's key (rowt #s92; it used to drop it)
